==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**15,500 grants 2 Elder [[Catfruit]].
**15,600 grants 5 Catamin As.
**15,700 grants 5 Catamin Bs.
*Added 1 new Catfruit: Gold Catfruit Seed.
*Added the ability to jump to Upgrade menu from Cat Equip screen.
*Added checkpoint system for [[Heavenly Tower]].
*[[Teacher Cybear]] nerfed:
**Time between attacks gets increased from 0 frames to 12 frames.
**Range decreases from 800 to 600
*Added 1 new item used in the 9th Anniversary Event gacha: Mystery Box.
*[[Catburger (Special Cat)|Catburger]] officially added in [[Nyanko Daisensou]].
*[[Coin Cat (Special Cat)|Coin Cat]], [[Maneki Cat (Special Cat)|Maneki Cat]], [[Mr. Ninja (Special Cat)|Mr. Ninja]] and [[Catburger (Special Cat)|Catburger]] + level cap increased to 20.
*Added 9th Anniversary [[Wildcat Slots]].
*Added 1 new unfinished feature, [[Cat Capsule]]+:
**Cat Storage increases from 64 to 128, similar to the [[Catfruit]] Storage.
**[[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] will sell for 2NP rather than 1.
**Adds [[Superfeline (Normal Cat)|a new unit]].

